ethean where everyone is a 6 inch doll and they all live in an apartment building it would be them surviving and learning to be human from the humans all around them. <br /> <br /> So I wanted to know would that be possible ?</div> </div> </div> </div>This idea is <i>awesome</i>. Consider it shamelessly stolen for my offline Saturday Beast game!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-20T10:35:56-07:00","id":1118613,"title":"","content":"I'd have one of their later milestones be merging together to form a single Promethean that is human sized and have <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=137Ei0C3Vdg\" target=\"_blank\">them play different aspects of that being's personality</a>. This would happen closer to the turning into a conflicted miserable human. Yay the human condition!<br /> <br /> I'd stat the being via the highest rating attribute of any PC and the highest skill ratings too, with all transmutations they all have, but run decision just like the linked video, and allow them to split a part into their individual forms.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>\u201cYouth ages, immaturity is outgrown, ignorance can be educated, and drunkenness sobered, but stupid lasts forever.\u201d </i>~ <b>Aristophanes</b><br /> <i>&quot;Virescit Vulnere Virtus&quot;</i> ~ <b>Stewart Clan Motto</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Frailty Chronicles</a></span><a href=\"http://forum.theo